---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { sitePath } from "../lib/sitePath";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Introduction"
  description="Undergraduate physics at IISER Bhopal — milestones and notes."
  wide
  pageClass="home-page"
>
  <div class="home">
    <div class="intro-hero">
      <div class="intro-text">
        <h1>Introduction</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Before I tell you more, let me tell you about the way I would like die.
          I really don't want to die, but we are bound to this mortal coil, so if I 
          had to choose, it would be falling into a <b><i>black hole</i></b>. A supermassive black hole,
          to be specific. I would inevitably be pulled into the singularity, and I just want to see what 
          actually occurs at the singularity. Do wormholes exist there? or will I just ripped to shreds? 
          What odd feeling will I experience there? Even after I've had a full meal, I dont think
          I will be satisfied even with this <b><i>dessert</i></b>. Such is human nature.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="intro-visual">
        <img
          src={sitePath("/images/black-hole.jpg")}
          alt="Supermassive black hole at the center of galaxy M87 (Event Horizon Telescope)"
          width="560"
          height="560"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <figcaption>
          <a
            href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Messier_87"
            rel="license noopener noreferrer"
            target="_blank"
          >M87*</a> · Event Horizon Telescope
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <p class="intro-followup">
      Hi! I'm Saathvik Bogam, a 2nd year undergraduate student at the Indian Institute of Science
      Education and Research, Bhopal. My interests lie in Physics and Mathematics, along
      with a bit of programming. I've made this website to track my academic journey
      , along with my notes for different core physics and mathematics courses. I also
      really enjoy philosophy and media analysis. My favourite pieces of fiction include 
      Steins;Gate, Sound! Euphonium and Land of the Lustrous, along with games like Hollow Knight and
      Rain World.
      
    </p>

    <ul class="actions">
      <li><a href={sitePath("/journey/")}>Timeline of milestones</a></li>
      <li><a href={sitePath("/notes/")}>Notes</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(24px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes fadeInDown {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-24px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes fadeInScale {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(0.94);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: scale(1);
    }
  }

  .intro-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr minmax(12rem, 16rem);
    gap: 2rem 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .intro-text {
    min-width: 0;
    animation: fadeInUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;
  }

  .intro-text h1 {
    animation: fadeInUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 60ch;
    line-height: 1.75;
    animation: fadeInUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) 0.15s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .intro-followup {
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 100ch;
    animation: fadeInUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) 0.25s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .intro-followup:empty {
    display: none;
  }

  .actions {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    animation: fadeInUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) 0.35s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .actions li {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .actions a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(168, 216, 200, 0.08);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(168, 216, 200, 0.25);
    border-radius: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .actions a::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(168, 216, 200, 0.08);
    transform: translateX(-100%);
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .actions a:hover {
    border-color: rgba(168, 216, 200, 0.5);
    background: rgba(168, 216, 200, 0.12);
    box-shadow:
      0 8px 24px rgba(168, 216, 200, 0.15),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .actions a:hover::before {
    transform: translateX(0);
  }

  .intro-visual {
    margin: 0;
    align-self: center;
    animation: fadeInScale 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) 0.2s forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .intro-visual img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    box-shadow:
      0 12px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35),
      0 0 1px rgba(168, 216, 200, 0.1) inset;
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 216, 200, 0.1);
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
  }

  .intro-visual img:hover {
    box-shadow:
      0 20px 60px rgba(168, 216, 200, 0.2),
      0 0 1px rgba(168, 216, 200, 0.2) inset;
    border-color: rgba(168, 216, 200, 0.25);
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  .intro-visual figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .intro-visual figcaption a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .intro-visual figcaption a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .intro-hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem 2rem;
    }

    .intro-text h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
      margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    }

    .lede {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .intro-followup {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .intro-visual {
      max-width: 16rem;
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .actions {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.8rem;
    }

    .actions a {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 140px;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .intro-hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .intro-text h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .lede {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .intro-followup {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .intro-visual {
      max-width: 100%;
      margin-inline: auto;
      order: -1;
    }

    .actions {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.7rem;
    }

    .actions a {
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .actions a:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
  }
</style>
